WEBVTT

00:00.500 --> 00:08.163
Like terms have the same letter and the same exponent. We can combine them. Here is an expression.

00:08.613 --> 00:14.603
Find the x squared terms. Two x squared plus x squared is three x squared.

00:15.053 --> 00:19.860
Now find the x terms. Three x plus five x is eight x.

00:20.310 --> 00:25.325
Put them together. The answer is three x squared plus eight x.

00:25.775 --> 00:32.105
We can only combine like terms. An x squared term and an x term are different,

00:32.105 --> 00:33.647
so they stay apart.
